    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math fascinating, especially its logical structure and real-world applications. As a chemistry and math enthusiast in upper secondary school, I enjoy solving problems and seeing how equations model nature. It’s not just abstract—it helps me think critically about the world.",
